      275.42
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 60 of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act,No. 9 of 2003, and the legal effect of the section as amended is to introduce a newpenalty in respect of offences committed under subsection (4A) of section 60 bycontravening any provisions of subsection (5) of section 20 of the said Act.",
