      185.25,
      228.77,
      379.53,
      252.35
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CONSUMER AFFAIRS AUTHORITYACT, NO. 9 OF 2003",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      162.33,
      265.61,
      402.38,
      289.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      162.33,
      304.25,
      402.33,
      327.83
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Consumer AffairsAuthority (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      162.33,
      342.89,
      402.33,
      378.83
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 60 of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act,No. 9 of 2003 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.29,
      393.77,
      402.34,
      417.35
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the insertion immediately after subsection (4)thereof, the following: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      201.33,
      432.29,
      402.37,
      492.83
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(4A) Any person who fails or refuses tocomply with an order made under subsection (5)of section 20 or acts in contravention of such ordercommits an offence and shall on conviction aftertrial before a Magistrate, be liable to -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      200.13,
      507.89,
      402.37,
      666.83
    ],
    "text": "(a) where such person is not a body corporate, toa fine not less than rupees one hundredthousand and not exceeding rupees fivehundred thousand or to an imprisonment ofeither description for a term not exceeding sixmonths or to both such fine and imprisonmentin the case of a first offence, and to a fine notless than rupees two hundred thousand andnot exceeding rupees one million or to animprisonment of either description for a termnot exceeding one year or to both such fineand imprisonment in the case of a subsequentoffence; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      147.81,
      344.45,
      152.81,
      355.79
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
