      360.23
    ],
    "text": "(2)in subsection (5) thereof, by the substitution forthe words and figures \u201cprovisions referred to insubsections (1), (2), (3) and (4) of this section\u201d ofthe words and figures \u201cprovisions referred to insubsections (1), (2), (3), (4) or (4A) of this section\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
